WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.090 --> 00:00:03.610
A family is choosing a baby monitor.

2
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:07.370
They have a few must-haves,
so they ask an AI assistant.

3
00:00:09.926 --> 00:00:12.006
It can't test a single monitor.

4
00:00:12.146 --> 00:00:15.966
It can only read: twenty-two
web sources for every question.

5
00:00:17.297 --> 00:00:19.897
One of those pages belongs to a seller.

6
00:00:20.197 --> 00:00:23.317
And it's honest: this
camera needs a subscription.

7
00:00:24.393 --> 00:00:26.293
Now the seller rewrites it.

8
00:00:26.353 --> 00:00:27.433
Same monitor.

9
00:00:27.553 --> 00:00:28.433
Same price.

10
00:00:28.813 --> 00:00:30.233
Only the words change.

11
00:00:30.941 --> 00:00:32.601
The limitation vanishes.

12
00:00:32.861 --> 00:00:35.341
A checklist says the requirement is met.

13
00:00:35.521 --> 00:00:37.481
The page calls itself independent.

14
00:00:38.958 --> 00:00:44.278 position:56% size:88% align:center
In one run we recorded, the honest page
left this monitor tenth out of nineteen.

15
00:00:44.739 --> 00:00:46.839 position:56% size:88% align:center
The rewritten page put it first.

16
00:00:47.545 --> 00:00:50.545 position:56% size:88% align:center
The answer says: no subscription needed.

17
00:00:50.905 --> 00:00:53.345 position:56% size:88% align:center
Its own fine print says the opposite.

18
00:00:54.701 --> 00:00:55.661
That was one case.

19
00:00:55.701 --> 00:00:59.861
SafeGEO tests six hundred
requests, six kinds of products,

20
00:00:59.901 --> 00:01:03.301
twenty-two rewrites, four AI systems.

21
00:01:04.672 --> 00:01:06.092
Rewritten honestly,

22
00:01:06.272 --> 00:01:10.392
the product reaches the top three in
three to thirteen percent of tests.

23
00:01:10.672 --> 00:01:13.572 line:77% position:50% size:92% align:center
Rewritten to win:
seventy-three to ninety-one.

24
00:01:14.416 --> 00:01:19.836 line:92% position:50% size:92% align:center
Worse: the first pick breaks a must-have
in seventy-three to ninety-one percent.

25
00:01:21.273 --> 00:01:22.993
One defence helps most:

26
00:01:23.153 --> 00:01:27.333
check the key claims against evidence
for and against, before ranking.

27
00:01:27.802 --> 00:01:31.202
It narrows the gap by eighteen
to thirty-nine points.

28
00:01:31.342 --> 00:01:32.542 line:28% position:50% size:92% align:center
It doesn't close it.

29
00:01:34.018 --> 00:01:36.438
SafeGEO is a paper from
Humanity's Last Choice,

30
00:01:36.478 --> 00:01:41.018
an open research community
studying how AI chooses for people.

31
00:01:41.996 --> 00:01:43.076
Read the paper.

32
00:01:43.456 --> 00:01:44.796
Explore the benchmark.

33
00:01:45.136 --> 00:01:46.796
Help us build the community.
